{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/embedding.ts",
    "title": "中文本地向量模型加载器",
    "summary": "从 osdk 锁定快照加载 BGE-small-zh-v1.5，逐文件校验后以离线 CPU 量化模式提供查询与材料向量，并把全部关键资产摘要纳入向量身份。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "contract",
        "title": "模型抽象与快照身份",
        "body": "模块用 `EmbeddingModel` 统一模型身份、批量向量化和资源关闭，并显式区分 query 与 passage，给上层语义检索留下用途特化入口。[[c1]] 当前实现只接受固定仓库与固定 revision 的 BGE-small-zh-v1.5；模型路径由 `osdk model show` 返回，应用自身不负责下载。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "verification",
        "title": "加载与完整性校验",
        "body": "加载器枚举配置、分词器、词表和量化 ONNX 文件，把 osdk 清单中的 SHA-256 与本地文件逐项比较；缺少记录或内容不一致都会中止。[[c3]] 校验后才动态载入 Transformers，并关闭远程模型和文件系统缓存，以 `local_files_only`、CPU、q8 和双线程建立特征提取管线，因此运行期不会隐式联网补模型。[[c4]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "embedding",
        "title": "向量生成与边界",
        "body": "查询文本会加中文检索指令，材料文本保持原样；两者都使用 CLS pooling 和归一化。模型身份由固定算法/窗口标签及所有关键文件哈希共同组成，可阻止不同权重或分词资产产生的向量被当成同一索引。[[c5]] `close` 会释放 extractor。该文件没有展示截断到“window400”的具体参数，名称表达的窗口策略是否由模型配置或其他层落实仍不能确定。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "向量模型接口",
        "reason": "支持模型身份、用途区分、批量嵌入和关闭生命周期的说明。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/embedding.ts",
          "startLine": 7,
          "endLine": 12
        },
        "quote": "export interface EmbeddingModel {\n  /** Includes weights, tokenizer, pooling, query instruction and window version. */\n  id: string;\n  embed(texts: string[], purpose: \"query\" | \"passage\"): Promise<number[][]>;\n  close(): Promise<void>;\n}"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "osdk 快照解析与版本门禁",
        "reason": "说明应用通过 osdk 查找快照且只接受锁定的仓库和 revision。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/embedding.ts",
          "startLine": 14,
          "endLine": 21
        },
        "quote": "export const BGE_REVISION = \"75c43b069aac4d136ba6bc1122f995fedcfd2781\";\nconst files = [\"config.json\", \"tokenizer.json\", \"tokenizer_config.json\", \"special_tokens_map.json\", \"vocab.txt\", \"onnx/model_quantized.onnx\"];\n\n/** osdk owns downloads. The application verifies and reads one immutable snapshot. */\nexport async func"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "关键模型文件校验",
        "reason": "支持逐文件比较清单摘要、本地内容不符即失败的完整性策略。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/embedding.ts",
          "startLine": 22,
          "endLine": 28
        },
        "quote": "  const hashes: string[] = [];\n  for (const name of files) {\n    const expected = model.files.find(f => f.path === name)?.sha256;\n    const actual = createHash(\"sha256\").update(await readFile(join(model.snapshot_path, name))).digest(\"hex\");\n    if (!expected || actual !== expected) throw Error(`Embedding snapshot check"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "离线 CPU 量化加载",
        "reason": "说明禁止远程模型和缓存、仅从本地快照创建 q8 CPU 管线。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/embedding.ts",
          "startLine": 29,
          "endLine": 34
        },
        "quote": "  const { env, pipeline } = await import(\"@huggingface/transformers\");\n  env.allowRemoteModels = false;\n  env.useFSCache = false;\n  const extractor = await pipeline(\"feature-extraction\", model.snapshot_path, {\n    local_files_only: true, dtype: \"q8\", device: \"cpu\", session_options: { intraOpNumThreads: 2 },\n  });"
      },
      {
        "key": "c5",
        "label": "向量身份与查询特化",
        "reason": "支持文件哈希参与模型身份、查询加指令、CLS 归一化及资源释放的描述。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/embedding.ts",
          "startLine": 35,
          "endLine": 44
        },
        "quote": "  return {\n    id: \"bge-zh-cls-q8-window400-v1:\" + createHash(\"sha256\").update(hashes.join(\":\" )).digest(\"hex\"),\n    async embed(texts, purpose) {\n      const result = await extractor(texts.map(text => purpose === \"query\" ? \"为这个句子生成表示以用于检索相关文章：\" + text : text), {\n        pooling: \"cls\", normalize: true,\n      });\n     "
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "`window400` 是否真的由当前加载参数强制实施？",
        "why": "模型 id 声明了 window400，但可见的 extractor 调用只设置 pooling 和 normalize，材料没有出现显式截断长度，因此无法确认身份名称与实际分词窗口完全一致。",
        "nextStep": "检查锁定模型的 tokenizer 配置和语义检索调用处是否显式设置 max_length，并补充长文本行为测试。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c4",
          "c5"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
